Package: MMVshiny
Type: Package
Title: Spec-Driven Reactive Input and State Management for Shiny Applications
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Venelin", "Mitov", email = "vmitov@gmail.com",
                    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Maintainer: Venelin Mitov <vmitov@gmail.com>
Description: Contains functions that help to handle reactive inputs and parameter specification in Shiny apps. 
  The package provides a set of functions that allow to define and update reactive inputs in a more structured way, 
  where the behavior of the inputs, such as their type, default value, and validation rules, is defined in an Excel
  file, and all the reactive code shiny code on the server and ui side is generated automatically at the start of the app.
